## 🚫 Operation Rules — Never Bypass

- `no-bypass-lint` — Never disable ESLint rules or add `// eslint-disable`
- `no-bypass-type-check` — Never use `@ts-ignore` or cast as `any`
- `no-bypass-commit-hook` — Never run `git commit --no-verify`
- `no-auto-deploy` — Never run deploy/publish/release commands on your own

